{"id":"154a2f9980ad7fad","group":"28","path":"28/28-prop-nl-contained-p.md","title":"对数非确定空间可在多项式时间判定","display":"prop-nl-contained-p — 对数非确定空间可在多项式时间判定","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-prop-nl-contained-p","aliases":["28-prop-nl-contained-p"],"display":"prop-nl-contained-p — 对数非确定空间可在多项式时间判定","depends_on":["[[28-df-nl]]","[[28-df-p]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 4.2 and §4.3","source_printed_pages":"80,87–89","source_pdf_pages":"106,113–115","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-prop-nl-contained-p"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-prop-nl-contained-p</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-nl-contained-p — 对数非确定空间可在多项式时间判定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba1abccdb0412836\" href=\"?note=ba1abccdb0412836\" title=\"28-df-nl\">28-df-nl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 4.2 and §4.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"80,87–89"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"106,113–115"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NL}\">\\(\\mathbf{NL}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf P\\)</span> 采用本目录机器与工作空间约定，见所列本地定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NL}\\subseteq\\mathbf P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NL}\\subseteq\\mathbf P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定NL机器在n位输入上的工作格总数O(log(n+2))，因此带内容、工作头、状态以及有界输入头合计只有(n+2)^{O(1)}个配置。枚举这些配置及一步转移，确定型广度搜索起点到任一接受配置的可达性；图规模和生成时间均多项式，等价于存在接受运行。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 4.2 and §4.3；印刷 pp.80,87–89 / PDF pp.106,113–115。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-nl","status":"resolved","id":"ba1abccdb0412836","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{NL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NL}\\subseteq\\mathbf P.","display":true}],"bytes":1423,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-286","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-conl]]、[[28-prop-nl-contained-p]]、[[28-cor-l-strict-pspace]]、[[28-df-savitch-reachability]]、[[28-prop-finite-reachability-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["ba1abccdb0412836","dd9febae42d44280"]}